        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]">Own-it Build</h3>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight"
            >Priced per project</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[40ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-warmgray">
          A one-time build you own outright — includes 5 months of hosting, then
          optional renewal. Scoped and priced around your project.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-warmgray">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            Custom design &amp; development
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span
              >You own the site — code, content, everything
              <span class="block text-xs text-muted"
                >Clean handover, no lock-in</span
              ></span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span
              >Essential SEO included
              <span class="block text-xs text-muted"
                >Titles, meta descriptions, AI-ready schema markup &amp; keyword
                checks</span
              ></span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.5"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
